    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cSummary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Sacred Capital of \u201cRafica\u201d, ruled by the Saint,<br>To honor her father\u2019s legacy, she became a knight \u2014only to walk straight into a trap.<br>Using forbidden magic, the protagonist narrowly escapes death\u2014 only to be saved by a church that worships an old goddess.<br>There, she uncovers the truth... and swears to bring down the Saint.<br>Framed and betrayed, this is her relentless fight to reclaim her name and expose the lies behind the holy throne...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cGame Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671800/extras/26ea286163df7de1257f917f48688783.avif?t=1755660592\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa\ufe0e Basic Info</strong><br>An RPG featuring dungeon exploration and strategic combat.<br>H-scenes: 90+\u00a0<br>Base CGs: 56 (includes 1 non-H CG, not including H character portrait) + variations\u00a0<br>Endings: 5 (includes 2 non-H endings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa\ufe0e Game Features</strong><br>\u2013 H-scenes feature moaning voice acting\u00a0<br>\u2013 Memory room (unlocked fully after clearing the game)\u00a0<br>\u2013 Includes lewdness &amp; exhibition system\u00a0<br>\u2013 Events can be skipped\u00a0<br>\u2013 Features erotic status effects\u00a0<br>\u2013 Easy mode available (reduced battle difficulty)\u00a0<br>\u203b Virgin clearance is possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cCharacter Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671800/extras/7198dd36673abbff07d745eeda5d0078.avif?t=1755660592\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Seleria\u3011</strong>(Name can be changed)<br>CV \u6d45\u6728\u5f0f\u69d8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story.<br>In her quest to revive her fallen family, she falls victim to the Saint\u2019s schemes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671800/extras/28eb26dfbbec3caa8b4f04602ab53801.avif?t=1755660592\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Nun\u3011</strong><br>CV \u5206\u500d\u6cb3\u539f\u30b7\u30db\u69d8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind-hearted nun who saves and shelters the protagonist.<br>Now follows the teachings of an ancient goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
